## 📄 Resume Builders & Tools

### CLI & Developer Tools
* [tech-resume (GitHub)](https://github.com/mzupan/tech-resume) — Command-line tool to build, version-control, and compile software engineering resumes.

### Web Builders
* [Kaagaz Resume](https://www.kaagaz.app/) — Lightweight, clean resume creation tool.
* [Resume.io](https://resume.io/) — Polished, ATS-friendly web resume builder with customizable templates.
* [Resume Genius](https://resumegenius.com/) — Step-by-step resume and cover letter builder.
* [ResumeGemini](https://resumegemini.com/) — AI-assisted resume formatting and editing.
* [HireRaft](https://hireraft.io/) — Dynamic resume personalization and review suite.
* [JobOwl](https://jobowl.co/) — Resume customization aligned with job descriptions.

