## 🧠 Resume Engineering & AI Prompts

Curated frameworks and system prompts to tailor resumes using LLMs (Claude, ChatGPT):

* [DAIR.AI Meta-Prompting Guide](https://www.promptingguide.ai/techniques/meta-prompting) — Core architectural guide to orchestrating meta-prompts for output refinement.
* [15 Claude Prompts for Resume Writing](https://medium.com/codetodeploy/15-claude-prompts-for-resume-writing-that-actually-get-you-interviews-f40c0393f561) — Field-tested prompts targeting metric-driven achievement statements.
* [Techpresso Resume Prompts](https://academy.techpresso.co/prompts/claude-prompts-resume) — Modular prompting templates for technical work histories.
* [LoopCV Guide to LLM Applications](https://blog.loopcv.pro/best-claude-prompts-for-job-applications/) — Strategy guide for parsing role criteria with LLMs.
* [Production Resume System Prompt (Reddit)](https://www.reddit.com/r/PromptEngineering/comments/1saa1z4/i_wrote_a_systemprompt_for_creating_and_editing/) — Production-ready markdown system prompt for editing technical CVs.

