## 🌐 Job Discovery & Hiring Platforms

### AI & Auto-Apply Portals
* [Arya by Mentoria](https://arya.mentoria.com/) — AI job hunting and career pathway assistant.
* [MyJobb AI](https://myjobb.ai/) — Intelligent role matcher mapping skill graphs to open roles.
* [LandOffer AI](https://landoffer.ai/) — End-to-end application tracking and recommendation suite.
* [HireDue](https://hiredue.com/) — Direct recruiter outreach and match automation.
* [HireFT](https://hireft.com/) — Automated full-time placement matching.

### Tech & Developer Job Boards
* [HiringCafe](https://hiringcafe.com/) — Aggregator pulling clean, un-scraped jobs straight from company ATS portals.
* [Instahyre](https://www.instahyre.com/) — Curated tech hiring platform connecting candidates with matching recruiters.
* [Cutshort](https://cutshort.io/) — AI-powered hiring network widely used by Indian tech startups and product companies.
* [Remote Rocketship](https://www.remoterocketship.com/) — Real-time directory for verified remote engineering roles.
* [CareerHound](https://www.careerhound.io/job-search/all?categories=technology) — Categorized tech and engineering career explorer.
* [Careerflow](https://careerflowcv.com/) — Comprehensive CRM and pipeline tracker for job applications.
* [JobLeads](https://www.jobleads.com/) — Executive and senior engineering job discovery.
* [TickBig](https://www.tickbig.com/) — Opportunity curation and candidate outreach engine.
* [Krawlr](https://krawlr.xyz/) — Fast crawler indexing direct career pages.

### Startup Ecosystem Maps
* [Bangalore Startup Map](https://www.bangalorestartupmap.com/) — Interactive map visualizing tech startup density across Bengaluru.
* [BLR Startup Arena](https://www.blrstartuparena.com/map) — Curated directory and geographical index of Indian tech companies.

### Compensation & Market Intelligence
* [Levels.fyi](https://www.levels.fyi/) — Verified salary benchmarks, leveling comparisons, and total compensation breakdowns.
* [Layoffs & Hires](https://layoffsandhires.com/) — Real-time tracking of hiring sprees, reductions, and headcount changes.

